# Invariants

Non-obvious failures live in [`docs/invariants.md`](docs/invariants.md). One catalog. Append entries. Do not add a second gotcha file.

When a fix must not regress:

1. Follow skill `capture-invariant` in the same change.
2. Lock it with a unit test.
3. The change is incomplete if the next session would have to be re-taught the failure.

Before editing a path named on an active entry, read that entry.

Do not add an always-on rule for a single bug. Extend the catalog.
